(a) the Counterparty shall provide a root-cause analysis and written remediation plan within [five (5)] Business Days of any Service Level failure;
(b) where the Counterparty fails to meet a Critical Service Level in any [three (3)] consecutive calendar months, the Company may terminate immediately for chronic failure without liability;
